flowchart TB
    UI["Browser dashboard<br/>Live · Historical archive · Simulated demo<br/>map · table · four charts · graph summaries"] --> API["FastAPI<br/>api.py · dashboard and history/model APIs"]
    API --> SVC["dashboard_service.py<br/>live request: 31-day cap · short-lived cache<br/>historical query: selected UTC date window"]

    SVC -->|Live mode| NASA["NASA POWER Daily point API<br/>T2M · RH2M · WS10M · PRECTOTCORR<br/>UTC · grid-cell estimates"]
    NASA --> NORM["Normalize and validate<br/>WS10M: m/s × 3.6 → km/h<br/>fill/missing values remain null"]
    NORM --> LIVE["Live dashboard response<br/>source metadata · latest values · prototype rule levels"]

    INGEST["Retry-safe historical ingestion<br/>50 NASA POWER requests · raw gzip retained"] --> DB["SQLite v2 historical archive<br/>333,860 daily-variable observations<br/>5 cities × 4 variables · 1981-01-01 to 2026-09-14"]
    DB --> HIST["Historical queries<br/>location · variable · UTC date range · daily resolution"]
    HIST --> SUM["Deterministic graph summaries<br/>computed from the exact plotted observations"]
    HIST --> MODEL["Cairo T2M ridge model<br/>one-day statistical estimate<br/>chronological held-out evaluation"]
    HIST --> ARCHIVE["Historical dashboard response<br/>observations remain distinct from model estimate"]
    SUM --> ARCHIVE
    MODEL --> ARCHIVE

    SVC -->|Simulated demo| DEMO["Bundled labelled demo observations"]
    DEMO --> RULES["Prototype threshold rules<br/>not official warnings or disaster predictions"]
    NORM --> RULES
    RULES --> INCIDENTS["Simulated/prototype incident panel<br/>does not contact emergency services"]
    INCIDENTS --> LIVE
    CARTO["CARTO basemap tiles<br/>map background only · not NASA data"] --> UI
    LIVE --> UI
    ARCHIVE --> UI

    classDef app fill:#0E1524,stroke:#22D3EE,color:#E6ECF8,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef nasa fill:#0B2732,stroke:#34D399,color:#E6ECF8,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef demo fill:#352819,stroke:#FBBF24,color:#FFF5D6,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef store fill:#13263B,stroke:#60A5FA,color:#E6ECF8,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef note fill:#171D2D,stroke:#8190AD,color:#D5DEEF,stroke-dasharray:4 3;
    class UI,API,SVC,NORM,LIVE,HIST,SUM,MODEL,ARCHIVE,RULES,INCIDENTS app;
    class NASA nasa;
    class DEMO demo;
    class DB,INGEST store;
    class CARTO note;